+- `reconstructed-inventory.json`
+- `independent_stage4_checks.py`
+- `procfs-readlink-shim.c`
+
+The independent checker reports 38 checks, zero failures.
+
+VERDICT: PASS
+LEGITIMACY: LEGIT
